WEBVTT

00:02:59.008 --> 00:03:01.385
using traditional knowledge and skills.

00:03:02.428 --> 00:03:05.640
Many of the houses in my village

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:10.436
still have roof made
of thatched sago leaves

00:03:10.436 --> 00:03:13.814
held together by cane vines

00:03:13.814 --> 00:03:17.526
and other renewable resources
from the nearby forest.

00:03:17.526 --> 00:03:21.405
The designs continue to change over time

00:03:21.405 --> 00:03:23.866
because of climate change,

00:03:23.866 --> 00:03:25.493
but I didn’t listen to them.

00:03:25.534 --> 00:03:27.828
You see, I went to a modern school.

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:30.122
I know more and I know better.